cal P(\\mathbb N)\\cup2^\\omega\\)</span>；集合与序列的转换函数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{AsSequence}\">\\(\\operatorname{AsSequence}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"565c3258eee2a5ff\" href=\"?note=565c3258eee2a5ff\" title=\"43-df-infseq\">43-df-infseq</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K\">\\(K\\)</span> 及自然数编码 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K(n)\">\\(K(n)\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"6cd902d852c2c848\" href=\"?note=6cd902d852c2c848\" title=\"43-df-prefixkolm\">43-df-prefixkolm</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{KTrivial}(A)\\iff\\exists c\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\left[K(\\operatorname{AsSequence}(A)\\upharpoonright n)\\le K(n)+c\\right].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{KTrivial}(A)\\iff\\exists c\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\left[K(\\operatorname{AsSequence}(A)\\upharpoonright n)\\le K(n)+c\\right].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>统一加法常数对全部长度有效。此定义允许不可计算集；不能把它误译为可计算性。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"43-df-prefixkolm","status":"resolved","id":"6cd902d852c2c848","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-prefixkolm]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-infseq","status":"resolved","id":"565c3258eee2a5ff","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-infseq]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-infseq","status":"resolved","id":"565c3258eee2a5ff","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$A\\in\\mathcal P(\\mathbb N)\\cup2^